    "limits": "Isolated shared raw backend with16/128/512TCP connections on one primary ring, not production Reactor/HTTP or multi-ring scheduling. Four rotated pairs per case, same total useful work, one-CPU/2GiB container. Actor thread CPU/RUSAGE_SELF excludes forked epoll producer; setup and terminal cancellation outside clocks. Stream unit4KiB; pingpong32-byte request plus1-byte ACK, one request in flight per socket. Each socket has a distinct four-byte repeating ID checked across fragments. Counts are separate executions/binary and include cancellation. Local loopback on WSL6.18, not target6.8 evidence. No inter-request caching."
